    `the foundation and its agent took reasonable care` IS FALSE
    `the cause` IS `recklessness as to the Act`
    `it obstructed, kept quiet, or was penalised before` IS FALSE
    `it told the Commissioner voluntarily before an examination was notified` IS TRUE
    `it told the Commissioner after an examination was notified, saving significant time` IS FALSE

`a careless misstatement disclosed during an examination` MEANS `My foundation's statement` WITH
    `it is false or misleading in a material particular` IS TRUE
    `the foundation and its agent took reasonable care` IS FALSE
    `the cause` IS `a failure to take reasonable care`
    `it obstructed, kept quiet, or was penalised before` IS FALSE
    `it told the Commissioner voluntarily before an examination was notified` IS FALSE
    `it told the Commissioner after an examination was notified, saving significant time` IS TRUE

`a misstatement made with reasonable care` MEANS `My foundation's statement` WITH
    `it is false or misleading in a material particular` IS TRUE
    `the foundation and its agent took reasonable care` IS TRUE
    `the cause` IS `a failure to take reasonable care`
    `it obstructed, kept quiet, or was penalised before` IS FALSE
    `it told the Commissioner voluntarily before an examination was notified` IS FALSE
    `it told the Commissioner after an examination was notified, saving significant time` IS FALSE

